          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Arms and armoury enthusiasts formed an appreciative audience for ISMC's guest speaker Dr Manouchehr Khorasani on Friday 6 November.  The lecture was chaired by ISMC Associate Professor, Dr Stephane Pradines and saw Dr Khorasani share insights from his new book; Persian Fire and Steel, Historical Firearms of Iran.  A world-renowned expert on Iranian arms and armoury, Dr Khorasani has written five books and co-authored four books, as well as publishing 147 articles in different journals across the world, winning the Book Prize of the Islamic Republic of Iran in 2009 and 2012. "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
